<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CMPC upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Chile's CMPC upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings upgraded Chilean paper maker Compania Manufacturera de Papeles y Cartones SA, or CMPC, to buy from hold.</p>
<p>No further details were available on the upgrade. The company is also known as Cartones.</p>
<p>(( --R. Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
</text>
